              "title": "Oblivion",
              "desc": "· Daze inflicted by the Agent increases by <color=#2BAD00>20%</color>. <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> ignore <color=#2BAD00>30%</color> of the enemy's All-Attribute RES.\n· After launching a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>, the whole squad's ATK increases by <color=#2BAD00>10%</color> and CRIT DMG increases by <color=#2BAD00>15%</color> for 20s, stacking up to 3 times. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
